## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Recruit
## Author: Devin
## Version: 1.11.0
## Notes: Rated players of your faction online right now, one ladder per bracket — 2v2, 3v3 and 5v5 side by side, highest first, under the sweep's progress bar — so you can find someone to queue with; each name has their race and talent-tree icons in front. Left-click a name to open your conversation with them in Commander Contacts (a plain whisper without it), right-click to invite, and click the dot beside a name to Watch them: Recruit keeps them on your friends list so you see when they are on without a sweep, and takes off again only the friends it added itself. Filled from everywhere a player can only appear while logged in (/who, the group finder, chat, guild, friends, players you see) and by Sweep: one /who per press, aimed by the Commander Ladder feed at the rated players not yet seen — arena matches, their guilds, their class and race — and the bar says what it asks next (without the feed: every class at level 70, split by race past /who's 50-name limit); bind it under Key Bindings > AddOns > Commander Recruit > Sweep: Next /who. A Search order list beside the board says which classes the sweep looks for and in what order: drag a class up or down, click it to skip it, and the board can hide the classes you skip. Ratings from Commander Muster and the Commander Ladder feed. Open it with /crecruit or the icon in the Social window's title bar (O).
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_BannerPVP_02
## SavedVariables: CommanderRecruitDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: CommanderRecruitWatch, CommanderRecruitProbe
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events
## OptionalDeps: Commander_Muster, Commander_Ladder, Commander_Contacts

